  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_017 (scvi_n200 RNA, imagenet_vit_l image, transformer aggregation, weighted fusion) achieves the highest accuracy (0.724989). This experiment tests whether replacing the RNA encoder with pca_n2000 (while keeping image encoder, aggregation, and fusion the same) affects performance. This isolates the impact of RNA encoder choice, a key design decision, and helps determine if scvi_n200 is optimal. It balances exploitation (building on the top-performing config) and exploration (testing a critical component)."
}

